update_rule.pseudocode:
for each non-adopting agent i:
  if i in stubborn set: stubborn=true else false
  x = frac_overall[i]; x2 = x*x; info = informed[i]; risk = risk_perception[i]
  layer_terms = gF*frac_F[i] + gW*frac_W[i] + gC*frac_C[i]
  logit = alpha + b1*x + b2*x2 + gI*info + gR*risk + gXR*risk*x + layer_terms
  if policy_active: logit += log(policy_odds_multiplier)
  logit += (benefit_perceived - compliance_cost)
  if adoption_function == 'logistic': p = sigmoid(logit); adopt_now = (rand() < p)
  else: update cumulative exposures E_i; adopt_now = (E_i >= K_i)
  if adopt_now and not stubborn:
    delay = round(LogNormal(mu_log, sigma_log))
    schedule adoption at day t+delay if still non-adopter then
emit signal.adoption_flags when scheduled adoptions trigger
